 "answer_verbatim": "**PriceLabs is the best all-around choice** if you want one tool for both setting nightly rates and researching a market before buying. Its dynamic pricing adjusts rates based on demand, seasonality, local events, and booking pace; its Market Dashboards let you compare similar listings and review metrics such as ADR, occupancy, revenue, and RevPAR.\n\nIf your main priority is **evaluating a specific property before purchase**, also consider **AirDNA Rentalizer**: enter an address to get a short-term-rental revenue forecast and market context. Treat any forecast as an estimate, not a guarantee—verify local rules, taxes, expenses, and comparable listings yourself.\n\n**Quick pick:** PriceLabs for pricing plus market research; AirDNA Rentalizer for a focused property-income estimate.",
